BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (poorly fitting submissions get deprioritized, while curated files actually close [MsdnoNJpPrg @ 00:07:26]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (economics check is simple: relying on one lender puts every commission at risk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (The income math has its own trap. Walton's formula is qualified conversations times close rate times average) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (commission. The classic beginner mistake is scaling conversations before the broker can reliably close: chasing leads,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (traffic and volume when raising the close rate is the faster path to money. This is how brokers end up busy but broke) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ([FnBYMtrQW9M @ 00:12:02]. The daily reality is firefighting: environmental assessment issues, credit problems and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (appraisal shortfalls. Income swings from $30,000 one month to $50,000 the next and $5,000 after that, and Walton puts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (it as a gut check: if that stresses you out, this might not be a fit [WUTiN5zYjnU @ 00:12:24]. Walton is equally direct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (that commercial deals take weeks, often months, and not every file funds. A pipeline has to be built and tended; it is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (a button that spits out money [408PWyXwwrI @ 00:06:29]. Truong flags a structural blocker for residential brokers) Tj ET
