BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (Prime plus zero, even Prime minus one, up to Prime plus 10 or 15; banks at SOFR plus 2 to 4% or Prime minus 2 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (Prime flat; revenue-based financing at 10% to 25 or 30% and up; venture debt at 15 to 25% with PIK and warrants) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm ([oobK7A-p9-U @ 00:56:44]. Committed facilities cost more than demand notes, and covenants can include minimum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (EBITDA, revenue, DSCR, FCCR and liquidity.) Tj ET
