BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Title: Route Non-Qualifiers to an Attorney-Led Restructure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Action: When refinance is off the table, place the file with attorneys who negotiate payment reductions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Detail: The attorneys negotiate the monthly payments down 50 to 80 percent, the owner pays the debt back in full, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (the file ends with a zero balance letter that clears the UCC filing [The Approved Guy - spCn3Rbs4XY @ 00:00:59].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (The speakers give the sizing and pricing math in hard numbers. Zoryn Capital's formula is that average monthly sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (roughly equals the average approval, so 50k a month in revenue means about a 50k advance. Factor rates run 1.14 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (1.45, with the average around 1.27 to 1.3. At 1.2, borrowing 100 dollars costs a fixed 120, whether you pay early or not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm ([ORF9Ue9ge8A @ 00:03:39]. Zoryn puts typical payback at 6 to 13 months, averaging 6. Across the market terms) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (span 3 to 24 months, and risky files sometimes get 1 month [ORF9Ue9ge8A @ 00:07:30]. Compressing the term drives) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (the effective cost up fast. Charles Rubio has seen APRs of 100 percent or more, and 200 to 250 percent on some) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (facilities [A8iNT8Ctrhk @ 00:14:42]. Neil Goldstein, the CRO who appears on Corporate Bankruptcy A to Z, says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (most advances sit between 60 and 90 percent interest. Loans, by contrast, have to stay within usury limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm ([50wAPhzWGmY @ 00:04:42]. Zoryn's profit test runs on the same numbers. Borrow 100 at 1.2, earn 300 in margin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (after cost of goods, and keep 180, which he calls effectively free money. He has seen both outcomes in his own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (high-end fashion company. Holiday inventory advances made a killing. Advances taken years later just to pay bills) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (helped sink the business.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (Each refinance route comes with specific qualification numbers. Granados lists credit floors of 660-plus FICO,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (680-plus or 640-plus across all three consumer bureaus. He also wants a debt service coverage ratio of preferably) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (1.25x, with 1.0 workable when other factors carry the file: average daily balances, NSFs, negative days and deposit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (frequency [lBvWGt7bnCw @ 00:00:52]. Siegel's bar for conventional financing is higher: 700-plus credit, net) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (profitability, time in business and securable assets. Below that bar he uses asset-backed takeouts: business-use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (HELOCs on terms up to 30 years, receivables facilities or invoice factoring, sale-leasebacks on equipment owned free) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (and clear, and stacked unsecured five-year term loans with a co-signer if needed [w-ETPb-Trek @ 00:07:10]. Boore's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (showcase file had five MCAs totaling over 1.5 million dollars, with payments above 300,000 a month. He refinanced it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (into a 10-year SBA 7\(a\) at prime plus 2.75 to 3 percent [8x-cfQhQpPU @ 00:03:30]. Adam Hookima of ProjectionHub) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (explains why that is so hard. The SBA requires a 10 percent improvement in monthly cash flow, which MCA files) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (usually clear. The problem is that the SBA lender needs first UCC position and a fixed payoff, and the MCA balance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (moves every day. So most SBA lenders simply refuse the file [_V39MGbzjw0 @ 00:01:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (Restructuring and settlement come with their own price sheet. Granados says a restructure cuts total monthly outflow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (by an average of 50 to 75 percent and reduces face value by more than 25 percent on average. It runs as a six-plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (month program, not an overnight exit [lBvWGt7bnCw @ 00:02:16]. Settlement shops price differently. Wadley reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (fees of 15 to 30 percent of enrolled or settled debt, with typical outcomes landing at 40 to 65 percent of the balance and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (no funder obligated to settle. He adds that the FTC rule generally bars a debt relief company from collecting a fee until) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (the debt is settled and a payment has been made [OWlnOeMGBkg @ 00:05:33]. Siegel puts most consolidator fees at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (15 to 25 percent of the book, or 15,000 to 25,000 dollars to consolidate 100,000 in advances. Before an owner signs, he) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (wants to see zero balance letters and proof that past clients' funders were actually paid [w-ETPb-Trek @ 00:13:49]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm (legal lever underneath all of this is getting the advance recharacterized as a loan. Goldstein walks through five factors) Tj ET
